�Para to oti upoleipetai se upsos, o Rotzer moiazei na ta ekhei ola: einai o pio epitukhemenos kunegos epikheirematikon talenton tes Norbegias, ekhei pantreutei ten panemorphe idioktetria mias gkaleri kai zei se ena oneiremeno spiti. Gia na kratesei omos ten isorropia sta oikonomika tou, exaskei kai ena deutero epaggelma, auto tou leste panakribon ergon tekhnes. Mia mera, tou dinetai e eukairia na organosei ten teleutaia megale douleia, aute pou tha ton glitosei apo ola ta khree. Mesa apo anexegetes katastaseis ostoso, tha metatrapei apo kunegos se therama kai tha khreiastei na palepsei gia te zoe tou. Ena tour nte phors drases kai saspens pou kobei ten anasa, to opoio badizei sta khnaria tes trilogias <>.
To biblio ekhei metapherthei ston kinematographo apo ton talantoukho norbego skenothete Morten Tilntoum kai ten etaireia paragoges Yellow Bird Productions, e opoia etan epises upeuthune gia ten paragoge ton tainion tes trilogias Millenium tou Stigk Larson . Ena rimeik tes apo amerikanous paragogous einai ede sta skaria. E tainia tha problethei stis ellenikes aithouses to kalokairi tou 2012 apo ten Odeon.
Otan oi Kunegoi kephalon ekdothekan to 2008, o Jo Nesbo idruse to Idruma Khari Khole -enan philanthropiko organismo gia ten katapolemese tou analphabetismou sta paidia tou Tritou Kosmou-, to opoio khrematodoteitai apo ta esoda tou bibliou Kunegoi kephalon kai ten kinematographike metaphora."�
�To kalutero muthistorema tou Tom Rompins einai edo kai einai e idia tou e zoe.
O Tom Rompins, mas upodekhetai sta idiaitera tou, phileuontas mas m' ena kommati thibetianes rodakinopitas. Mono aphou te phame, katalabainoume oti den einai mia koine rodakinopita.
To euphantasto khioumor tou, e asteireute logotheke tou, e astamatete "trele sophia" tou xekhunontai mes' ap' ten aphegese tou kai mas katakluzoun, mas entuposiazoun, mas diaskedazoun kai mas kanoun na pistepsoume, en telei, pos e, nai! piso apo ta muthistoremata pou latrepsame den tha mporouse na brisketai para monos kapoios me mia tetoia zoe, te zoe tou Tom Rompins.
Idou, loipon, o suggrapheas."�

�
To 1969 e zographos Emma Regies esteile ston philo tes istoriko Kherman Arsiniegas ten prote apo tis eikosi treis epistoles pou perigraphoun tis skleres sunthekes mesa stis opoies kulese e paidike tes elikia. O philos tes sugklonisteke apo tis epodunes autes anamneseis ki apophasise na deixei ta keimena ston Gkampriel Gkarsia Markes, o opoios entharrune te Regies na sunekhisei to grapsimo. E allelographia kratese os to 1997* s' auto to diastema, o Arsiniegas kataphere na parei ten egkrise tes Emma Regies gia na ekdosei tis epistoles meta ton thanato tes.
Me mia graphe pou xekhorizei gia ten entimoteta kai ten apousia kathe epitedeuses, e Regies aphegeitai tis antixootetes ton paidikon tes khronon sten Kolombia stis arkhes tou 20ou aiona, otan ten egkateleipsan mazi me ten aderphe tes s' ena monasteri. Khoris autolupese, me euphuIa enelikou kai matia koritsiou, kataphernei na metadosei me akribeia ston anagnoste ta sunaisthemata tes.
Mia realistike kai empneusmene perigraphe tou pos kapoios mporei na anaduthei apo athlies sunthekes kai na xekhorisei.
Kirkus Reviews
Oi anagnostes, kathos diabazoume tis Anamneseis di' allelographias, epises megalonoume apotoma, opos e Emma Regies, kai khamogelame.
El Pais
Ena kataplektiko keimeno pou, perissotero apo pote, einai e idia e zoe.
ABC Cultural"�

