O Giente Giongka, metanastes apo to Kameroun pou zei sto Kharlem mazi me te suzugo tou Neni kai ton exakhrono gio tous, den pisteuei sten tukhe tou otan to phthinoporo tou 2007 proslambanetai os sopher tou Klark Entouarnts, anoterou dieuthuntikou stelekhous tes Lehman Brothers. O Klark zeta apo ton Giente akribeia, diakritikoteta kai aphosiose, kai o Giente einai prothumos na sebastei tis epithumies tou ergodote tou. Otan e Sinti, e gunaika tou Klark, proteinei ste Neni na ergastei to kalokairi sten exokhike katoikia ton Entouarnts sta Khamptons ki ekeine dekhetai, oi duo oikogeneies erkhontai pio konta.
Ta pragmata deikhnoun na kuloun omala, kai e oikogeneia tou Giente phainetai na apolambanei tis mikres khares tes zoes ste Nea Uorke. Ksaphnika omos o tomeas tes oikonomias klonizetai suthemela me ten katarreuse tes Lehman Brothers. O Giente kai e Neni theloun apegnosmena na kratesei o Giente te douleia tou, akoma kai an auto semainei oti tha khreiastei na paroun duskoles apophaseis kai eno o gamos tous den menei anepereastos apo tis epiptoseis tes Megales Upheses...
Ena muthistorema sto opoio, metaxu allon, thigontai o thesmos tou gamou, to thema tes metanasteuses, oi taxikes kai phuletikes diakriseis, kathos kai oi atheates, skoteines ptukhes tou Amerikanikou Oneirou.
<>.
