�Enas gios. Enas pateras. Mia mana. Mia aderphe. Enas philos. Enas summathetes. Mia gkomena. Ellenes. Korallia. Axurista kephalia. Kai e zougkla. Poios tha nikesei;"�
�"The mistakes of the fool are known to the world,
but not to himself." - Charles Caleb Colton, English writer
If the road to damnation is paved with the best of intentions, then the road to disaster is paved with what, at first sight, appeared to be a smart move. History's Biggest Blunders features a crop of humongous historical bloopers, ordered chronologically, and categorized into military, religion, culture, politics, scandal, environment, and everyone's current favorite, economics.
Chapters include:
* Conspirators Murder Julius Caesar
* Napoleon Sells Louisiana
* Britain Invades Afghanistan
* Hitler Invades Russia
* Europe Introduces the Euro
This beautifully presented volume, with over 80 photographs, paintings, and illustrations, shines a light on the people and personalities behind some of history's biggest blunders."�
�Mia neare oikogeneia metakomizei s' ena mikro spiti opou diapistonei kati teratodes: to esoteriko tou spitiou tous einai megalutero apo to exoteriko tou. Bebaia, oute o brabeumenos me Poulitzer photoreporter Gouil Nabintson oute e suntrophos tou Karen Gkren, etan proetoimasmenoi n' antimetopisoun aute ten paradoxoteta, os ten emera pou oi phones ton duo mikron paidion tous arkhisan na diegountai mian alle istoria - mia istoria me apto skotadi, me mian abusso pou megalonei aenaos piso apo ten porta mias ntoulapas, kai gia ekeino to anosio boueto pou den th' argesei na gkremisei tous toikhous tous kai na katasparaxei ola tous ta oneira.
Prin apo khronia, otan to "Spiti apo phulla" arkhise na kuklophorei, den etan tipota parapano apo kati khartia stoibagmena prokheira, merika apo ta opoia, kapou kapou, anaduontan sten epiphaneia tou Internet. Kaneis den mporouse na phantastei oti, kapote, aute e tromakhtike istoria tha apoktouse euarithmous, alla pistous opadous. Ksekinontas apo mia eteroklite suntrophia perithoriakon nearon (mousikoi, kallitekhnes tou tatouaz, programmatistes, striper, periballontologoi kai adrenalinomaneis), to biblio kataphere na phtasei sta kheria kai palaioteron geneon, pou okhi mono anagnorisan tous eautous tous mesa s' aute ten allokote selidopoiese, alla kai anakalupsan ena dromo gia na epistrepsoun ste zoe ton apoxenomenon paidion tous.
Otan, argotera, auto to ekplektiko muthistorema kuklophorese se morphe bibliou pleres, me tis khromatistes lexeis tou prototupou, me kathetes uposemeioseis kai duo nea parartemata, anagnoristeke apo ten kritike kai to koino os to apoluto metamonterno muthistorema epistemonikes phantasias, logotekhniko thriler, istoria tromou kai tautokhronos lampro dokimio gia te skhese pragmatikotetas kai anaparastases, pou stadiaka metatrepei ton anagnoste se matheteuomeno mago kai erasitekhne ntetektib."�
�Poio kheri einai auto pou kinei pragmatika ta nemata;
Mia apolaustike istoria sten opoia o anagnostes os to telos anarotietai poios einai to paidi kai poios o enelikas, poios einai o kalos kai poios o kakos, pou teleionei e epinoese kai pou arkhizei e aletheia. Mia ode sten paradose ton istorion tromou me anaphores se biblia opos Stripsimo tes bidas (Khenri Tzeims), E gunaika me ta leuka (Gouilki Kolins), Rempeka (Daphne Nti Morie).
Mia perithoriake persona, e eroida, aphegeitai se proto prosopo ten istoria tes. Bgazei to psomi tes prospherontas sexoualikes khares se antres (den uparkhei sexoualike epaphe, douleuei mono me to kheri) kai kapoia stigme epeide pathainei sundromo karpiaiou solena apo ten uperergasia anabathmizetai kai arkhizei na ergazetai os mentioum. Krataei omos kapoious apo tous pio pistous kai palious tes pelates. Otan tha ten episkephthei e plousia kai euthrauste Souzan, tha brei te khruse eukairia na bgalei parapano paradaki katharizontas ten aura tou spitiou tes, to opoio einai ena megaro opou e Souzan zei me ton gio kai ton diataragmeno, kata ta legomena tes, progono tes."�

