...O gamos ginetai ten Kuriake kai prokalei ten anatrope sto taxidi. Taxidi sto paratetameno kalokairi mias gunaikas sta maura kai tou mikrou giou tes. Mana kai paidi penthoun enan antra khameno sta khronia tou polemou. Plerophories den uparkhoun para mono upothetiko penthos, upothetike orphania.
Kai tora to taxidi. Makrino kalokairino taxidi apo ten Athena ston Ebro* taxidi phortomeno distagmous kai epithumies. Ekei tha 'rthoun antimetopoi me ola ta dilemmata tes zoes tous, epoduna kai gemata apo tis khares pou tous leipoun. Pano tous, mia upoule sunastria eironikon asterismon* kai mesa s' ola o gamos, san oxumoro peristatiko metaxu trelou paneguriou kai tragodias.
Oi eroes tes istorias autes tha paixoun kai tha mplekhtoun mesa ston khrono. Sto paron kai sto mellon, me tis triklopodies tou aoristou... Gi' auto kai ta aisthemata tous, entona oso pote, tha enelikiothoun me epikindune takhuteta. Mesa apo te matia tou paidiou ki enos kalokairiou me sustatika ton erota, to pathos, ton thanato kai to gelio. Opos e idia e zoe. Kai piso ap' ola o gamos, san proskhema sobaro, me ten asteia athooteta tou.
Tora ti skhese mporei na ekhei o Iordanes Makres me ton Iordane Leontiou kai ten koine tous lakhtara gia to taxidi-peripeteia, as to aphesoume se osous summerizontai tous griphous kai apodekhontai ten prosklese ston gamo tes Kuriakes.
GIANNES KsANThOULES"�
�E Nora ki o Khares zoune tis teleutaies meres tou gamou tous, dialumenou ap' ton khamo tou exakhronou giou tous Aggelou. Ospou ena bradu o Aggelos erkhetai s' ena moirasmeno oneiro, kai tous uposkhetai pos an epistrepsoun ston topo tes sternes tous paratherises kai proboun sten upertate thusia, tha epistrepsei konta tous. Mono pou otan briskontai kai pali sto apomonomeno exokhiko tes Khalkidikes, o Khares kai e Nora diapistonoun oti to phragma anamesa se phuse kai uperphusiko ekhei katarreusei, oti to oneiro apekhei mia anasa ap' ton ephialte, ki oti to parelthon sunekhizei na zei, pantodunamo."�
�Otan o nearos phoitetes Alesantro Phontana exaphanizetai xaphnika apo ten Mpolonia, e metera tou zetaei te boetheia tou Gkampriele Ampiati, paliou tes gnostou kai erasitekhne ntetektib. O Gkampriele me te boetheia tou philou tou, Nikola Milano, anazetoun ten tukhe tou nearou se mia skoteine ki ekhthrike Italia, mekhri pou enas gnostos suggrapheas astunomikes logotekhnias ekdidei to teleutaio tou muthistorema. To biblio tha kinetopoiesei enan oloklero mekhanismo antidraseon aphou phainetai na xethabei thanasima mustika, kala krummena mekhri tote, mias tromokratikes omadas pou edrase sto Milano ta taragmena khronia tes dekaetias tou '70, kai na skhetizetai amesa me ten exaphanise tou Alesantro.
O kruphos purenas ton Eruthron Taxiarkhion einai mia katabuthise sta molubenia khronia, me tis politikes anakatataxeis, ta klasika autokineta, ta mikra mousika gkroup progkresib, ten amphisbetese, alla kurios me te skia ton tromokratikon omadon...
E ekdikese kai to aima tha ekhoun ton proto logo s' aute te nea upothese tou Nikola Milano kai tou Gkampriele, eroon tes Khamenes Bibliothekes tou Demetre Mostra.
